{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misotoolbartop"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasLargeTitle"},{"type":"text","text":" is), because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".principal"},{"type":"text","text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".navigationSubtitle()"},{"type":"text","text":" (iOS 26+), which would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasLargeTitle"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Appearances","anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"misoNavigationBarAppearance"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"helper of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationStack"},{"text":" for example.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Technical-constraints","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Technical constraints"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Platform-considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Platform considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Badges-uses","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Badges uses"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the MISO badge component does not provide a suitable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  MISO badge component is always used."}]},{"anchor":"Code-sample","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code sample"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                MISOToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: MISOToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                MISOToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                MISOToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.1.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 1.4.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"deprecated":false}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOToolBarTopV","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOToolBarTop"}],"title":"MISOToolBarTop"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The top toolbar (aka ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and controls related to the current view.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It can contain leading, principal (center, single item only), and trailing actions.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":